    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Hi, I am Maliha Javed, originally from the remote areas of Chitral, Pakistan. I am working as a Research Associate at Aga Khan University's Centre for Regenerative Medicine and Stem Cell Research (AKU-CRM).",
